;;
8) cat <<'T'
REDIRECTS, PIPES, HERE-DOCS
cmd > f       overwrite     cmd >> f   append     cmd < f   read from f
cmd 2> f      errors only   cmd > f 2>&1   both in one file   cmd 2>/dev/null   hide errors
order matters: cmd > f 2>&1 is right, cmd 2>&1 > f is not
cmd | cmd2    output of one becomes input of the next     tee f   copy to a file and the screen
